| C-C5 | C-Q4 InnerSigTransplanted (wrapped; the dsks route `abl_d` predicted) | depth1.cone | 55 s / 352 MB |
| C-C5 | C-Q8, link 4 | depth0.cone | 33 s / 370 MB |
