**Correct-form controls** on the same slices and queries are all `is true`.

**Not addressable by slicing:**
- C-C8-i (greens only);
- C-C8-ii's required C-Q5 green;
- C-C7(ii)'s composed C-Q7 and honest-key authorship (not run);
